MIDI FILES AND SOURCE EVIDENCE

Each MIDI file has its own recorded Public Domain or CC0 status in
catalog.json. The corresponding source URL, license URL and scope are part
of that record. No blanket license is asserted over third-party source
prose, dataset compilations or unrelated arrangements. See NOTICE and
PROVENANCE.md for those separate layers.

